msgid ""
"What this game copied so far is deleted; games already installed stay. The "
"USB drive isn't changed. Press the back button to keep installing."
msgstr ""
"Co tato hra dosud zkopírovala, se odstraní; již nainstalované hry "
"zůstanou. USB disk se nezmění. Pro pokračování v instalaci stiskněte "
